# XQuery: XQuery 3.1 (W3C Recommendation 2017), A.2 Lexical structure; requirements/languages/xquery.md
name     xquery xq xqy

keyword  xquery version encoding module namespace declare import schema function variable external
keyword  for let where order by group stable ascending descending return if then else some every in
keyword  satisfies typeswitch switch case default try catch as at instance of treat castable cast to
keyword  element attribute text document comment processing-instruction and or div idiv mod union
keyword  intersect except
builtin  true false fn:count fn:concat fn:string fn:doc fn:data count concat string doc data
builtin  string-join contains substring

ident-part     -.:
block-comment  (: :)  : nested
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
sigil    $    : attr
operators  =!<>+*|/:,
calls
